            "heading": "Are your products cruelty-free?",
            "text": "<p>At <em>Beautify</em>, compassion is non-negotiable. Every product we create is 100% cruelty-free from concept to finished formula. We never test on animals, and we never work with suppliers who do. It’s part of our clean beauty commitment: makeup that’s kind to skin, and even kinder to the world.</p>"
