            "text": "<p>All <em><strong>Beautify</strong></em> formulas are dermatologically tested and undergo rigorous safety checks before they reach your hands. We carefully formulate to reduce the risk of irritation, and list every ingredient transparently. If you have sensitivities, we recommend reviewing our full ingredient lists or speaking with your doctor for peace of mind.</p>"
